<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective March 15.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.42     23.97	  4.59-9.82  4.32-9.55</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.42     23.97	  4.40-9.39  4.12-9.12</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.78     26.37	 12.36	12.05</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.78     26.37	  7.82	 7.53</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.26	  0.39	 0.39</p>
</text>
